      "text": "```\nGREIGE (GRAY) GOODS                                      FINISHED FABRIC\nRaw woven/knitted fabric                                 Ready for garment\nOff-loom; flat, stiff,                                  making; colored,\nnatural color; no surface                               soft or crisp as\ntreatment                                               specified; sized,\n                                                        treated\n    ↓                ↓              ↓              ↓\nPREPARATION      COLORATION     PRINTING      FINISHING\n===========      ==========     =========     =========\nScouring         Dyeing         Block         Mechanical:\n(remove oils)    (fiber-level)  Screen          mercerize\n                               Digital          sanforize\nDesizing         Printing      Roller           calender\n(remove sizing)  (surface                       nap/raise\n                  pattern)     Discharge        shear\nBleaching                      Batik/Ikat\n(whiten)                       Tie-dye        Chemical:\n                                               resin (DP)\nMercerizing                                    DWR\n(optional,                                     antimicrobial\n cotton)                                       flame retardant\n```"
